# No nested buttons

Invalid HTML: `<button>` wrapping another `<button>` (Galley meal-plan week grid was the incident).

- Cell / card wrappers that contain controls are `div`s.
- Assign and remove (or any two actions) are **sibling** buttons, not parent/child.
- If you need a clickable row plus an inner control, make the row a `div` with `role="button"` only when there is no inner `<button>` — prefer two sibling buttons.
